  title "Xuzhong's Judgment"
  summary "Luminary Xuzhong Pelm'Oath presides over an emergency tribunal trying two orcas—Ruibung and Grandfather Blood—for trespassing at the sealed Drowned Ledge, stealing the Thrumed~ Shadow-glass, and practicing unsanctioned rituals. Prosecutor Laizhe builds a case suggesting coordinated raid activity and theft of critical fire-core reserves, but the orcas' witness Rend Kzulrora testifies that they were desperate survivors seeking refuge in an already-abandoned outpost, and that Grandfather Blood's presence was spiritual rather than strategic. Xuzhong finds Ruibung guilty of trespass and theft but not of coordinated raid activity, sentencing both orcas to permanent exile beyond the berg's shadow at the next tide, a verdict that leaves the outcome ambiguous and morally unresolved."
